<title>THAILAND: Samaggi Insurance '96 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Samaggi Insurance '96 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reviewed financial results for Samaggi Insurance for 1996 ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 9.04		     12.21</p>
<p>    Net			135.60		    183.14</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Samaggi Insurance Plc, an insurance firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
